## Unicode Character Database — `src/case_tables.zig`

`src/case_tables.zig` is the set of code points whose simple lowercase
(resp. uppercase) mapping differs from themselves (`UnicodeData.txt` fields
13/12) in Unicode 15.0.0, as Go 1.26's `unicode.ToLower` / `unicode.ToUpper`
answer them; it is generated by `tools/go_casetables` and compiled into the
module (the `lowercase` / `uppercase` formats test against it). It is a
TRANSFORMED form of the data, not a copy of the file: each set is re-encoded
as (lo, hi, stride) runs. The Unicode License v3 permits modification; the
